<title>USA: DigiMedia says gets ok for merger, split.</title>
<headline>DigiMedia says gets ok for merger, split.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>DigiMedia USA Inc said Wednesday its shareholders approved a merger with NITROS Franchise Corp.</p>
<p>The company also said its board approved a 7-for-1 reverse split of its stock.</p>
<p>The company said it was changing its name to NITROS Franchise Corp in conjunction with the merger.</p>
</text>
